  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **nashville to kentucky** (1 review): The taper described this specific song as beautiful during the middle night run [3]\n- **rollin' back** (1 review): The taper highlighted the seldom-played track as a personal favorite of the performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-12-30.ECM_MS907** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 119 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: The taper felt the recording sounded pretty good despite using a simple rig [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The combination of the music and the lighting was described as simply phenomenal [4]\n- A friend who had never heard the band before was totally enthralled by every song [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-12-30.ECM_MS907**: taped by John Parsons; transferred by John Parsons; source: ECM MS907 (90 degree setting) -> Sony MZ-R37 MD Recorder [1]. Also: The audio was converted via Total Recorder Pro 6.0 and Flac Frontend to FLAC16 [1]",
